WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.640
Evening. You came back.

00:00:05.675 --> 00:00:10.779
Ten of you. Give or take.

00:00:10.779 --> 00:00:14.454
I know every name.

00:00:14.454 --> 00:00:18.000
Ten months. You're still here.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.760
On stream, I'm the good one.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:28.000
Calm voice. I call the game.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.520
I hang up. It all comes out.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:36.000
I hit the desk. "That ain't a ron."

00:00:37.282 --> 00:00:39.563
Ten people, watching.

00:00:39.563 --> 00:00:41.829
East round. First hand.

00:00:41.829 --> 00:00:46.344
Wife and kids, asleep upstairs.

00:00:46.344 --> 00:00:51.000
And I'm still on the air.

00:00:55.385 --> 00:00:57.904
The AI does the work.

00:00:57.904 --> 00:01:00.141
Slack, Jira, all the code.

00:01:00.141 --> 00:01:02.390
So what did I do with it?

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:04.280
Mahjong, till morning.

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:06.861
March. A million on the line.

00:01:06.861 --> 00:01:09.447
Two years to pay. They took a month.

00:01:09.447 --> 00:01:11.509
All of it, due. We went short.

00:01:11.509 --> 00:01:14.103
I told her the rent might go.

00:01:14.103 --> 00:01:16.151
Imported ramen. I bought it twice.

00:01:16.151 --> 00:01:18.398
Three times the price. Then four.

00:01:18.398 --> 00:01:20.439
I can still pay for that.

00:01:20.439 --> 00:01:23.000
I ate it all. That's enough.

00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:26.747
Ten people, watching.

00:01:26.747 --> 00:01:29.164
South round. Third hand.

00:01:29.164 --> 00:01:33.671
Wife and kids, asleep upstairs.

00:01:33.671 --> 00:01:38.000
And I'm still on the air.

00:01:43.182 --> 00:01:47.000
The notes. The blog. I wrote them.

00:01:47.781 --> 00:01:51.699
Every Friday, the letter.

00:01:51.699 --> 00:01:55.954
Hundreds of people read them.

00:01:55.954 --> 00:02:00.095
Night comes. I'm back to ten.

00:02:00.095 --> 00:02:04.907
Mid-stream, she climbs on my lap.

00:02:04.907 --> 00:02:09.062
A few nights went like that.

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:14.004
I win. "So good!" goes out live.

00:02:14.004 --> 00:02:18.680
I lose. "You suck." No mercy.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:20.694
Ten people, watching.

00:02:20.694 --> 00:02:23.018
Not tonight. I'm not going live.

00:02:23.018 --> 00:02:27.633
Year twenty-one. October fourth.

00:02:27.633 --> 00:02:32.000
I'm going up the stairs.
